{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06391","headline":"同张员外諲詶荅之作 · 李颀","name":"同张员外諲詶荅之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛中高士日沈冥，手自灌园方带经。\n王湛牀头见周易，长康传里好丹青。\n鶡冠葛屦无名位，博[弈]赋诗聊遣意。\n清言只到衞家儿，用笔能夸锺太尉。\n东篱二月种兰荪，穷巷人稀鸟雀喧。\n闻道郎官问生事，肯令鬓发老柴门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}